    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adb3431d393e9758fb2e50a0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "或许多亏在脑中与一百倍的敌人对峙，\n她成功展现出流畅的“舞蹈”。\n……八重无敌的战斗才正要开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ca7e31b3b2f683d737c5599cc803a3e199c7af12fa1130cc4f2fb3341739f06",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072506.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4620fd916e1d60ab3189849e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八重无敌的舞蹈一开始都还好，\n但她不知为何总是会越跳越兴奋，\n然后使出攻击。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55749a090ca62f27b09064f3a386be9516dc0d502ddc54f251c9306a01ec96c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072506.json",
      "json_path": [
