      "uid": "zhcn:130c1b6d178685da09e12b49",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说来惭愧……因为舞蹈和武术有共通之处，\n所以我才觉得只要想成是在练习“形”\n就没问题了──",
      "source_fingerprint": "42c8a01c0275816c303827125027366ded734175233f5d3dd7683eb13b6210af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
